mpris-miniplayer (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add synchronized shuffle and repeat controls to the player window and
    status indicator menu.
  * Add an adaptive, scrollable queue for players with MPRIS TrackList
    support.
  * Allow queue selection from the status indicator menu.
  * Add a preference to keep the player queue open after track selection.
  * Refresh the application and symbolic status indicator icons.

